      "asset_id": "wikimedia:File:Comparison of graphical projections.svg",
      "heading": "Alberti's window becomes a **ratio**",
      "sentence": "A 3-D program's virtual camera divides each point by its **depth**: twice as far, half as big. It is Alberti's construction, now computed **millions of times** a second.",
      "quote": "Of all the projections employed in computer graphics, the perspective projection is one most widely used.",
