      "heading": "Plausible is not the same as **possible**",
      "sentence": "Around 1750 Piranesi etched prisons whose stairs and bridges look convincing yet cannot all connect. Image generators make depth in a similar way: from **learned plausibility**, with ==no scene== behind it.",
